    "pin": {
      "title": "Pont Alexandre III",
      "description": "Deck arch bridge in Paris",
      "extract": "The Pont Alexandre III is a deck arch bridge that spans the Seine in Paris. It connects the Champs-Élysées quarter with those of the Invalides and Eiffel Tower. The bridge is widely regarded as the most ornate, extravagant bridge in the city. It has been classified as a French monument historique since 1975.",
